---
source: cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "e.run(&[\"put\", \"--help\"], \"\")"
---
exit: 0
--- stdout
Add files and folders (recursively) to a vault folder

Usage: tijori put [OPTIONS] <LOCAL>... <VAULT_DIR>

Arguments:
  <PATH> <PATH>...  Local files or folders, then the vault folder to put them in

Options:
      --vault <PATH>         The drive, or its TIJORI folder. Found automatically when exactly one
                             vault is mounted
      --with-recovery        Unlock with the 24-word recovery phrase instead of the password
      --with-keyfile <PATH>  Unlock a password + keyfile slot with this keyfile
      --password-stdin       Read passwords, phrases and confirmations from standard input, one per
                             line, instead of prompting on the terminal
  -h, --help                 Print help
--- stderr
